    "text": "<p>According to molecular orbital theory&nbsp;the configuration is like that<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> bond order increases so it is more favourable.<br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mat